**Incident Description:**  
The ATE application in the PROD environment experienced an anomaly where zero trades were observed in the last 5 minutes, as detected by the "ate_no_recent_trades" rule on 2026-05-04. The root cause is linked to the delayed execution of the "daily_trade_import" job on 2026-04-24, which exceeded its duration threshold (55.2s vs. 50s) due to degraded SAP response times. This delay likely impacted the availability of trade data in the ATE system. Subsequent imports completed successfully, indicating the issue was transient.  

**Business Impact:**  
The absence of recent trade data may have affected real-time trade monitoring and reporting capabilities for the ATE application.  

**Recommended Action:**  
Monitor the "daily_trade_import" job for further delays and investigate SAP response time degradation to prevent recurrence.
