**Business Impact:**  
The delayed trade data availability may have impacted downstream processes reliant on timely trade information, though no ongoing issues are observed.  

**Recommended Action:**  
Review and optimize the "daily_trade_import" job's performance thresholds and SAP response times to prevent recurrence. Monitor future job executions for anomalies.
