**Incident Description:**  
The ASCM application in the PROD environment is experiencing a data pipeline issue, with the TARGETDATE stuck at 2026-05-03 instead of progressing to 2026-05-05. This issue has been ongoing since the ETL job `load_target_frequency` failed to complete for TARGETDATE 2026-04-29, as indicated by the SLA breach alert logged on 2026-04-29. The failure disrupted the daily data pipeline, preventing subsequent data updates. This impacts business operations reliant on up-to-date ASCM data, potentially causing delays in downstream processes.  

**Recommended Action:**  
Investigate and resolve the failure of the `load_target_frequency` ETL job for TARGETDATE 2026-04-29 to restore the daily data pipeline and ensure TARGETDATE progression. Validate the ETL job's configuration and dependencies to prevent recurrence.
