**Incident Description:**  
The ATE application in the PROD environment is experiencing an issue where no trades have been processed in the last 5 minutes, as detected by the "ate_no_recent_trades" rule. This issue was first observed on 2026-04-29. Logs confirm that the "daily_trade_import" job successfully imported 1,243 trades from SAP into the ATE system at 05:30 UTC on 2026-04-29, indicating that the import process is functioning as expected. However, trades are not being processed or executed downstream, suggesting a potential issue with a downstream component or process responsible for trade execution.  

**Business Impact:**  
Trade execution delays may impact business operations reliant on real-time or near-real-time trade processing.  

**Recommended Action:**  
Investigate downstream components or processes responsible for trade execution to identify and resolve the processing bottleneck.
