The ATE application in the PROD environment is experiencing an issue where no trades have been processed in the last 5 minutes, as detected by the "ate_no_recent_trades" rule on 2026-05-05. Logs confirm that the "daily_trade_import" job successfully imported 1,243 trades from SAP on 2026-04-29, indicating that the import process is functioning as expected. This suggests a downstream issue in the ATE system where trades are not being processed or executed after import. The root cause is currently unknown and requires further investigation into the trade processing workflows.  

**Business Impact:**  
Trade processing delays may impact downstream systems and business operations reliant on timely trade execution.  

**Recommended Action:**  
Investigate the ATE trade processing workflows to identify and resolve the issue preventing trades from being processed post-import.
