**Incident Description:**  
The ATE application in the PROD environment is experiencing an issue where no trades have been processed in the last 5 minutes, as detected by the "ate_no_recent_trades" rule. This issue was first observed on 2026-05-05. Logs confirm that the "daily_trade_import" job successfully imported 1,243 trades from SAP on 2026-04-29 at 05:30 UTC, indicating that trade data is being imported correctly. However, the absence of recent trades suggests a potential downstream issue in the trade processing or execution pipeline.  

**Business Impact:**  
Trade processing delays may impact operational reporting and downstream systems reliant on real-time trade data.  

**Recommended Action:**  
Investigate the trade processing workflows downstream of the "daily_trade_import" job to identify and resolve any bottlenecks or failures.
