**Incident Description:**  
The ATE application in the PROD environment has experienced failures in the 'daily_trade_import' job since 2026-04-22. The root cause on 2026-04-22 was expired credentials for SAP user `ATEBOT`, as confirmed by logs, which were resolved through password rotation. On 2026-04-27, the job failed again due to a SAP RFC communication error (`COMMUNICATION_FAILURE`) with the application server `ate-sap-prod.uniper.energy`. These failures disrupted trade imports, impacting business operations reliant on timely trade data processing. Recommended actions include reviewing SAP credential management processes and investigating the stability of the SAP RFC connection to prevent recurrence.
